<title>USA: Peak Tech names Cohen president, COO.</title>
<headline>Peak Tech names Cohen president, COO.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Peak Technologies Group Inc Thursday said it named Howard Cohen, 50, as president and chief operating officer, effective March 1, 1997.</p>
<p>Cohen will leave his position as president of OCE Office Systems, a division of OCE Van der Ginten N.V. He succeeds John Coutts who retired in 1996.</p>
